{
  "$comment": "Which harness version svc was last tuned against, and which areas of the harness svc depends on. scripts/harness-drift.mjs compares the installed version with tuned_version, reads the release notes in between, and lists entries that touch a watched area: 'Added' entries are adopt candidates, the rest are check candidates. After acting on them, record the new baseline with `harness-drift.mjs mark-tuned`. To track another harness, add a hosts entry with version_cmd, tuned_version and a changelog_url whose notes use <Update label=...> sections; watch areas and keywords are plain data and can be extended by people or models. Keywords match whole words, case-insensitive; entries tagged for a surface in skip_surfaces (\"[VS Code] ...\") are ignored.",
  "hosts": {
    "claude": {
      "version_cmd": [
        "claude",
        "--version"
      ],
      "tuned_version": "2.1.296",
      "tuned_on": "2026-10-10",
      "changelog_url": "https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog.md"
    }
  },
